foundry-emulators-consoles-heavy (1.0.7) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add rpcs3 (0.0.42+dfsg) — vendored from foundry-apt; Sony PlayStation 3
    emulator and debugger. Closes the seventh-generation PlayStation gap.
    PS3 firmware is copyrighted and is not shipped; the user installs it.

