foundry-emulators-consoles-heavy (1.0.6) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add flycast (2.6) — vendored from foundry-apt; Sega Dreamcast, NAOMI and
    Atomiswave emulator. Closes the last sixth-generation console gap.
  * Drop the "all in Ubuntu universe (no licensing issues)" claim from the
    description: it has been inaccurate since ppsspp, snes9x-gtk, mesen2 and
    bsnes-jg were vendored, and snes9x-gtk in particular ships under a
    non-commercial licence. Replaced with a note that firmware is not shipped.

 -- Foundry Linux <packages@foundrylinux.org>  Wed, 05 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

